": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XKIp-8XCWzIQ7kNvwF4IGKR&_nc_oc=AdpdAKQG22xEQTVUBLvoUzRB73aIqxy9jwZYdqun51Ma-PxXm03_xoTaawfzFAkpcKs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPrYAG-KH5olJsLSkPUF6GbNVLatqpsRLybk3Gx3eCCfA&oe=6AE4C09B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nTVlHk3APwwQ7kNvwGA6WNd&_nc_oc=AdrKm1fpPMNsZoNJ3CIadkSOwcDZqfiJt92UvB8ANYcZ25f0oCAaxe3jacqE6Gknoxc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPhnlN1DwShef4iBGmhX1KsE0ot_v2hXUrHA5K3pYKAoA&oe=6AE4B0E1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hA0D33iJZokQ7kNvwHpumDz&_nc_oc=AdpM1nR-bgvfbuFhFWUqXKhdqTHHbro6DJ8MbeqI5oWGVV4fXY4P6gC-ZP2H9aKZias&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNNvbaQ4yJQPIKQnwg4euqFL3vuEAnDCvFuZKuyflUH0Q&oe=6AE49DAF"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1QIEPUDqleQQ7kNvwHAmpw8&_nc_oc=AdoX98pBLVzuAtB6b4ZG1m1vSkp4-fQ0KjJWYMoy9E5_UDD0w1uPo4Ioh5AJuwHQdS0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNA_-efTc6rYONAp9S9MnjsfoWF25XLDGN3auT2G2Xp7A&oe=6AE49D52"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mPYro9rnl54Q7kNvwEBPbrW&_nc_oc=Adqki601hMzRLZ-_x-Rd8uKg0jL6Y_Nzu26npU8XEeel9tx24xhMJKDEgs8J0J76J3U&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMcSfVDNjUufZ2O6eeJpewWEyOZJP-ioso3JnHZDjQhmQ&oe=6AE4A6FD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://bs.a